  "version": 3,
  "versions": {
    "1": "2026-11-08: the first texts of product keynotes, a part of the arc a grammar: the title, the opening, the one idea, the reveal, the features, the demo, the price, one more thing and the closing line (D59)",
    "2": "2026-11-09: the free slides' own provocations: a word or two over a full-screen picture, in the format's voice (D63)",
    "3": "2026-11-13: shorter texts for the lower field limits (D80): the reactions, the demo's errors, one more thing's titles, the reveal's shots and the price's label; and the presenter's job on a line of its own under their name"
